<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>To use this macro, just choose a start key and put it to work, it will automatically increase both the fruit and the level and statistics, so it's very useful and good, I hope you like it, anything you can talk to me and I'll change something, in I'll soon make a macro to pick up and do missions alone</Description>
    <Comment>hope you like it s2</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 29 1
KeyDown 6 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 6 1
Delay 64
Delay 64
KeyUp 29 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 27 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 27 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 25 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 25 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 5 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 5 1
Delay 64</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>